Source: satori-branding
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: satori project <noreply@satori.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), librsvg2-bin
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: satori-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, base-files
Description: satori branding: os-release, GRUB theme, wallpaper and logo
 Identifies the system as satori: /usr/lib/os-release (and so
 /etc/os-release) describes satori, with Devuan's copy diverted to
 /usr/lib/os-release.devuan so that base-files upgrades can't restore it.
 .
 Also ships satori's GRUB theme (copied to /boot/grub/themes/satori, which
 GRUB can read before an encrypted root is unlocked), the default wallpaper
 and the logo. The artwork is licensed CC-BY-SA-4.0.
